--- server
import { posts } from '../content.config'

const entries = await posts.all()
---
---
import PostMeta from '../components/post-meta.kay'
---
head
  title(raw) devlog, notes on building software
.mx-auto.max-w-2xl
  section.mb-12
    h1.mb-3.text-3xl.font-semibold devlog
    p.mb-3.text-subtext I'm #[a(href="https://github.com/Kayno0o") Kévyn], a French full-stack developer based in Bordeaux. I've been coding since I was twelve, the last four years for a living, mostly with Bun, TypeScript, Astro, SolidJS, Svelte and Vue/Nuxt. Away from the web, I love Godot and build Minecraft mods and tools. More #[a(href="/about") about me].
    p.text-subtext These are notes on the software I build: how it works, what it costs, and the benchmarks behind it, starting with #[a(href="https://kayjs.kaynooo.fr") kay], a Bun web framework.
  section(aria-labelledby="posts-title")
    h2#posts-title.mb-4.font-mono.text-sm.tracking-wide.text-muted.uppercase Posts
    ol.flex.flex-col.gap-6
      for post of entries key={post.slug}
        li
          a.group.block.no-underline(href={`/posts/${post.slug}`})
            PostMeta(date={post.data.date} file={post.file})
            h3.text-lg.font-semibold.group-hover:underline.group-hover:decoration-accent {post.data.title}
            p.text-subtext {post.data.description}
      else
        li.text-subtext Nothing published yet.
